{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And I will overturn</b> — For many wars were destined in the days of the prophet, when he prophesied that it would be so, and we know that thus it was, only we have not found the ancient books to know the wars that were in the days of this Darius the Persian and in the days of Artaxerxes who reigned after him, and in their days Zerubbabel was prince over Judah, for he is Sheshbazzar, [proven] by complete proofs from Scripture."], :book :haggai, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Haggai" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/hagai"] ["Ibn Ezra on Haggai -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/hagai"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:35.305743563Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}